        DescriptionEn: Every third transition launches a separate strike at a new
          nearby target, creating a second chain circuit.
        Id: chain_storm_final_3
    - NameRu: "\u041F\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0438\u0442"
      NameEn: Chain Leech
