        \u0435\u0433\u043E \u0442\u044F\u043D\u0435\u0442."
      DescriptionEn: Develops the Gravity Well branch and its signature behavior.
      Id: gravity_well
      Element: freeze
      BranchCard:
        NameRu: "\u041A\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0434\u0435\u0446"
        NameEn: Gravity Well
        DescriptionRu: "\u041F\u0440\u0438\u0442\u044F\u0436\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435
